@startuml epic-e-command-event
!theme plain
title Epic E: 影像數據分析（歷史訓練） - Command-Event 對應

left to right direction

package "Commands" {
  usecase "SwitchAnalysisTab\n切換分析分頁" as C1
  usecase "BatchDeleteTrainings\n批次刪除訓練" as C2
}

package "Events" {
  usecase "AnalysisTabSwitched\n分析分頁已切換" as E1
  usecase "TrainingsBatchDeleted\n訓練已批次刪除" as E2
}

C1 --> E1
C2 --> E2

note right of E1
  **分頁類型**:
  - training-records
    (訓練記錄查詢)
  - player-records
    (選手紀錄查詢)
end note

note right of E2
  **批次刪除**:
  可同時刪除多筆訓練
  及其投球資料
end note

@enduml
